SUMMARY:Armando Anto
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:Armando Anto is an internationally touring comedian and classic
 
ally trained violinist who has turned the violin into one of stand-up comed
 
y's most unexpected weapons. Featured on NBC\, CBS\, Cirque du Soleil\, Dry
 
 Bar Comedy\, Amazon\, and Hulu\, Armando's comedy has earned millions of v
 
iews online and taken him to stages across the world. With razor-sharp come
 
dy\, music\, and a French-Iranian-American perspective\, Armando doesn't ju
 
st perform stand-up---he puts on a show. Prepare for a night where elegance
 
 meets chaos... and no topic is off-limits. *******************************
 
*********** SCAM ALERT---IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMATION *********************
 
********************* To protect our customers\, please DO NOT purchase tic
 
kets from third-party sites such as StubHub\, VividSeats\, BoxOfficeTicketS
 
ales\, EventTicketCenter\, eTickets\, Ticket-Center\, TicketSales\, or any 
 
other unauthorized platforms. These sellers are not affiliated with us and 
 
often charge inflated prices. All tickets purchased through our official si
 
te are WILL CALL ONLY --- they will not be emailed to you. You will receive
 
 a confirmation email after your purchase\, and your tickets will be availa
 
ble for pick-up at the door on the night of the show. We will never ask you
 
 to call a 1-800 number. If you have any questions\, please call us directl
 
y at 562-202-9944. Our ONLY authorized ticketing partner is TicketWeb\, whi
 
ch is linked directly from our website: TheStandUpClub.com. Ticket resale i
 
s strictly prohibited. Tickets suspected of being purchased for the sole pu
 
rpose of resale may be canceled at the discretion of The Stand Up Club. To 
 
ensure your tickets are valid\, always purchase directly from TheStandUpClu
 
b.com or TicketWeb.com. Stay safe. Don't get scammed. Tickets & info: https
 
://www.ticketweb.com/event/armando-anto-the-stand-up-comedy-club-tickets/14
 
448184
